{
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub rag ask <question>"
,
"zh"
:
"在知识库中搜索问题答案（默认搜索 mod + 个人知识库）。"
,
"en"
:
"Search the knowledge base for answers (defaults to mod + personal knowledge)."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub rag ask <question> --scope mod"
,
"zh"
:
"仅搜索 x-cmd 官方模块文档。"
,
"en"
:
"Search only x-cmd official module docs."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub rag upload <file>"
,
"zh"
:
"上传文件并加入 AI 检索索引（消耗 token）。"
,
"en"
:
"Upload a file and index it for AI search (charges tokens)."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub rag list"
,
"zh"
:
"列出已上传的知识库文件。"
,
"en"
:
"List uploaded knowledge base files."
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x hub rag quota"
,
"zh"
:
"查看当月 RAG token 用量。"
,
"en"
:
"Show this month's RAG token usage."
}
]
,
"ask"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"在知识库中搜索问题答案。默认搜索 mod 和个人知识库，可通过 --scope 指定范围。"
,
"en"
:
"Search the knowledge base for answers. Defaults to mod and personal knowledge, scope can be specified via --scope."
}
,
"--scope|-s"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"指定搜索范围，可选值为 mod、knowledge 或 skill。"
,
"en"
:
"Specify search scope, available values are mod, knowledge, skill."
}
,
"#cand"
:
[
"mod"
,
"knowledge"
,
"skill"
]
}
,
"--org"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<org>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"团队组织名（scope=knowledge 时改查团队共享知识库；须为该组织成员）"
,
"en"
:
"Team org name (with scope=knowledge, queries the team shared knowledge base; requires membership)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"要搜索的问题。"
,
"en"
:
"The question to search for."
}
}
}
,
"upload|put"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"上传文件并加入 AI 检索索引，按文件大小消耗 token（约 1 字节 = 1 token）。上传后需等 AutoRAG 下个同步周期（最长 1 小时）才能被搜到。token 配额不足时整个上传被拒绝。"
,
"en"
:
"Upload a file and index it for AI search. Charges tokens by file size (~1 byte = 1 token). Searchable after the next AutoRAG sync cycle (up to 1 hour). Upload is rejected entirely when token quota is insufficient."
}
,
"--force|-f"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"覆盖已存在的同名文件（覆盖会重新索引并再扣一次 token）。"
,
"en"
:
"Overwrite an existing file with the same name (re-indexes and charges tokens again)."
}
}
,
"--org"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<org>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"上传到团队共享知识库（须为组织 member+，扣团队 token 配额）"
,
"en"
:
"Upload to the team shared knowledge base (requires org member+, charges the team token quota)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"要上传的文件路径。"
,
"en"
:
"File path to upload."
}
,
"#exec"
:
"___x_cmd_advise__file"
}
}
,
"list|ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"列出已上传的个人知识库文件（平铺展示所有文件）。"
,
"en"
:
"List uploaded personal knowledge base files (flat listing)."
}
,
"--org"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<org>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"改为列出团队共享知识库文件（须为组织成员）"
,
"en"
:
"List the team shared knowledge base instead (requires org membership)"
}
}
}
,
"delete|rm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"删除知识库中的指定文件或目录（目录整体递归删除）。已消耗的索引 token 不退还。"
,
"en"
:
"Delete a file or directory from the knowledge base (directories are removed recursively). Tokens already spent on indexing are not refunded."
}
,
"--org"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<org>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"从团队共享知识库删除（须为组织 member+）"
,
"en"
:
"Delete from the team shared knowledge base (requires org member+)"
}
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"要删除的文件名或目录路径。"
,
"en"
:
"File name or directory path to delete."
}
}
}
,
"quota"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"查看当月 RAG token 用量、剩余额度与重置时间。"
,
"en"
:
"Show this month's RAG token usage, remaining quota, and reset time."
}
,
"--org"
:
{
"#synopsis"
:
"<org>"
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"查看团队 RAG 配额（须为组织成员）"
,
"en"
:
"Show the team RAG quota (requires org membership)"
}
}
}
}

